{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもそばで支えてくださって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9枚目シングルで私は今回も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜メンバーに選んでいただきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポジションは3列目です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組で私の思いをしっかり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伝える事ができなかったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここに書かせていただきます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長いですが読んで下さい>_<"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7枚目シングルで加入間もない時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センターに選ばれました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右も左も分からないまま周りに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"支えられ、自分は何をしたらいいのか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直ふわふわしたままでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも8枚目シングルでフロントに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なり初めて自分の立場や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今やるべき事が見えてきて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自信も少しずつ持てるようになって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の人に成長したね！と言って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いただける事が多くなりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃からどんな時もずっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へらへら笑ってた私が一時期、前程"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑わなくなったのに気がついたのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族や昔からの友達に言われて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"からでした。楽しい毎日だけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと無意識に色んな事を考えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いたのかも...だけど今はそんな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"余計な事は考えなくなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって考える時間ももちろん必要"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど私は考えすぎたらダメに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なっちゃうんです..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスや歌が出来ないなら出来るまで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"練習すればいい！失敗を気にする"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んじゃなくてやっぱり色んな私を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てもらいたいしファンの人に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「堀ちゃん見てたら元気出たよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"癒されたよ！」って言ってもらう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"為には私自身が楽しまないとって♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岐阜から上京をしてきて本当に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の方に支えられてきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校をすぐ辞めて荷物をまとめて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いってきます！って出てきたものの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芸能界や東京は私が想像していた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よりもはるかに大変で..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私を支えてくださったのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりファンの皆さんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので今回の選抜発表でポジション"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を聞いた時、1番に皆さんの顔が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出てきて涙が止まらなかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念だねと沢山言われました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん私もこの場所で満足している"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"訳ではないけど...でも、ここが本来の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のスタート位置だと思うし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はこのポジションで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと成長した姿を皆さんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てもらえるように。そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂になりたいって強く思った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーディションの時の気持ちをずっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れずに乃木坂46だけにこれからも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身全霊を掛けていきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔から笑顔だけは褒められるの( ˃̶̤ ·̫ ˂̶̤ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑ってた方が楽しいもん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周りにいる人も自然と笑顔にさせる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな魅力を持った人になりたいな☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2014/05/13/7962159/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9枚目は10枚目に向けて1つの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くくりとなるシングルだと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の私はがむしゃらに努力するのみ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パフォーマンス力、表現力、演技力..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学んで身につけて成長できるように、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこにいても輝けるように、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全力で頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にとっても乃木坂にとっても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きく成長できる夏にしたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援よろしくお願いします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2014/05/13/7962159/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀未央奈"}],"source":"archive"}